BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Academic/Educational/Intellectual
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the First International Symposium of Latino Oral H
 istory\, “Listening as Resistance: Oral History\, Memory and the Latino E
 xperience” taking place virtually on November 6–7. This two-day symposium
  will bring together scholars\, students\, educators\, writers\, and comm
 unity members to explore the power of oral history and Latino storytellin
 g as tools for preserving lived experiences\, amplifying voices\, and cha
 llenging dominant historical narratives.\nWe are honored to welcome accla
 imed writer\, journalist\, and University of California\, Irvine professo
 r Héctor Tobar as our keynote speaker.\nWe invite participants to submit 
 an abstract to present their work or register to attend and learn more ab
 out Latino storytelling and oral history practices.\nBest paper will get 
 a chance to be published in an academic journal.\nStudent registration is
  free.\nPlease register for the symposium with the link below:\nhttps://m
 ontclair.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_cYowQOHwct2em0K\nTo submit an abst
 ract: \n https://montclair.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_1N6j22Uqp6ulqiq\
 n\nHosted by: Association of Latino Professionals For America\, Bloomfiel
 d Student Life\, Bloomfield Lambda Sigma Upsilon Latino Fraternity\, Inc.
 \, Center for Latino Heritage & Spanish Language Excellence\, Dominican S
 tudent Organization\, Ecuadorian Students Association\, Latin American St
 udent Organization\, Latin@ Caucus\, Mexican-American Student Association
 \, Office for Hispanic Initiatives\, Puerto Rican Student Organization\, 
 Peruvian-American Student Organization\, Student Life At Montclair (SLAM)
 \, Spanish and Latino Studies\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: 
 https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12626778
DTEND:20261107T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261107T055208Z
DTSTART:20261106T140000Z
LOCATION:Online
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:1st International Symposium of Latino Oral History
UID:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12626778
URL:https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12626778
X-HOSTS:Spanish and Latino Studies
END:VEVENT
