DESCRIPTION:Not sure what major to choose or where your career path is hea
 ded? You’re not alone! Join us for Major & Career Exploration Talks: What
  We Wish We Knew Before Declaring!\, a dynamic panel event where uppercla
 ssmen students share their real\, unfiltered experiences about choosing t
 heir majors and navigating their career journeys. Hear firsthand what the
 y wish they knew before declaring\, the challenges they faced\, and how t
 hey found their passions. Whether you're feeling undecided\, overwhelmed\
 , or just curious about different paths\, this event will give you insigh
 ts\, inspiration\, and practical advice to help you make informed decisio
 ns. Don’t miss this opportunity to gain valuable perspectives and take th
 e next step in your academic and career journey! *Food and refreshments w
 ill be served!\nThis workshop is presented by The Discovery Program. To c
 ontact the Discovery Program\, email us at discoveryprogram@montclair.edu
 \, or visit us at montclair.edu/discovery-program.\n\nHosted by: The Disc
 overy Program\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montclai
 r.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12497728
