 ay symbolizing joy and unity.\nThe flag raising is at the Student Center 
 Flag poles from 2:00pm - 2:30pm\nThe gathering after is at the Advocacy &
  Outreach Office\, Suite 113 of the Student Center from 2:30pm - 3:30pm\n
