DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night filled with laughter\, music\, dancing\,
  and unforgettable memories! Join the Bangladesh Student Association for 
 our annual Mock Dholki\, a fun-filled celebration inspired by the traditi
 onal pre-wedding festivities celebrated across South Asia.\nEnjoy live pe
 rformances\, energetic dances\, classic dholki songs\, interactive games\
 , delicious food\, and plenty of surprises throughout the evening. Whethe
 r you're performing\, cheering on your friends\, or simply coming to expe
 rience the vibrant culture\, this is an event you won't want to miss.\nDr
 ess in your favorite traditional attire\, bring your friends\, and come c
 elebrate an evening of culture\, community\, and joy with us. We can't wa
 it to see you there!\n\nHosted by: Bangladesh Student Association \, Paki
 stani Student Organization\, South Asian Student Association\n\nAdditiona
 l Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/ev
 ent/12912508
