DESCRIPTION:Do you know how to knit or crochet (or do any other craft)? Do
  you want to learn? Do you have no idea what that is but it sounds cool? 
 Come to Montclair Unraveled!\nJoin us and learn how to knit\, crochet\, o
 r do any other fiber art you're interested in. You don't need any experie
 nce to join! We have all the supplies you could need\, and they're free f
 or you to use and keep. Come learn how to make plushies\, accessories\, a
 nd clothes!\nAll are welcome at Unraveled\, no matter how much or how lit
 tle experience you have! Come to learn\, work on your own projects\, and 
 hang out with other people who have the same hobby as you. :)\n\nHosted b
 y: Montclair Unraveled\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https:/
 /montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12832524
