DESCRIPTION:Checking Accounts & Digital Wallets Workshop\nBank Smarter\, S
 pend Wisely\, and Take Control of Your Money!\nJoin TRIO SSS and EOF for 
 an informative and interactive workshop designed to help you make smart b
 anking decisions and confidently navigate today's digital financial tools
 .\nWhether you're opening your first checking account or looking to bette
 r understand digital payment options\, this workshop will provide practic
 al information to help you manage your money safely and effectively.\nWor
 kshop Topics:\n\n\nImportant questions to ask before opening a checking a
 ccount\n\n\nWhat to consider when choosing a bank or checking account\n\n
 \nUnderstanding banking fees\, account features\, and benefits\n\n\nExplo
 ring digital wallets and how they work\n\n\nLearning safe practices for m
 aking digital payments and protecting your financial information\n\n\n\nH
 osted by: Bloomfield Educational Opportunity Fund Program\, Bloomfield TR
 IO (SSS) Student Support Services\n\nOnline Location:  https://montclair.
